---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
        title="About · Amine Bahij"
        description="About Amine Bahij, a computer science student working at the intersection of backend engineering, software architecture, and operations research."
>
    <Navbar />

    <main>
        <section class="about-hero">
            <div class="container about-grid">
                <div class="about-copy">
                    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>

                    <h1>I turn complex decision problems into maintainable software systems.</h1>

                    <p class="lead">
                        I am a computer science student at TU Dortmund working at the intersection
                        of backend engineering, software architecture, and operations research.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        My work ranges from Spring Boot backends to reusable Python infrastructure
                        for mathematical optimization. I focus on clear architecture, testing,
                        documentation, and turning complex models into usable software.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <aside class="profile-card card">
                    <div class="profile-photo">
                        <img src="/images/amine-bahij.jpeg" alt="Amine Bahij" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <h2>Amine Bahij</h2>
                        <p>
                            Computer science student at TU Dortmund University building backend and optimization software with a focus on clear architecture.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </aside>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section">
            <div class="container content-grid">
                <article>
                    <p class="section-kicker">Direction</p>
                    <h2>Engineering systems for complex decisions</h2>

                    <p>
                        My work connects backend engineering with operations research. I use
                        mathematical models to understand complex decision problems and design
                        maintainable software systems that make their solutions usable.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        This allows me to move from rigorous problem formulation to tested,
                        documented, and reusable software.
                    </p>
                </article>

                <article>
                    <p class="section-kicker">Focus</p>
                    <h2>Engineering with structure and reliability</h2>

                    <p>
                        I focus on backend systems with clear boundaries, maintainable architecture,
                        and reliable interfaces.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Testing, documentation, and reproducible workflows are integral parts of
                        how I build software.
                    </p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>


        <section class="section stack-section">
            <div class="container">
                <div class="section-header">
                <div>
                    <p class="section-kicker">Stack</p>
                    <h2 class="section-title">Tools and practices I work with</h2>
                </div>
                </div>

                <div class="stack-grid">
                <article class="stack-card">
                    <h3>Backend Engineering</h3>
                    <p>Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, PostgreSQL, Flyway</p>
                </article>

                <article class="stack-card">
                    <h3>Operations Research</h3>
                    <p>Python, GurobiPy, Timefold Solver, mathematical modeling</p>
                </article>

                <article class="stack-card">
                    <h3>Architecture & Quality</h3>
                    <p>Modular design, clear interfaces, automated testing, documentation</p>
                </article>

                <article class="stack-card">
                    <h3>Delivery & Tooling</h3>
                    <p>Git, GitHub, GitLab, Docker, CI/CD, reproducible workflows</p>
                </article>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="section compact-section">
            <div class="container note card">
                <p class="section-kicker">Working style</p>
                <h2>Research. Build. Test. Optimize. Iterate.</h2>

                <p>
                    I try to approach technical work with a mix of mathematical thinking and
                    pragmatic engineering: understand the problem, build a clear first version,
                    test assumptions, document trade-offs, improve the system step by step,
                    and keep asking the critical questions.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
    .about-hero {
        padding: 5.5rem 0 3.5rem;
    }

    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 340px;
        gap: 3rem;
        align-items: start;
    }

    .about-copy {
        max-width: 760px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
        margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 820px;
        font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 6vw, 5.2rem);
        line-height: 0.98;
        letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    }

    .lead {
        margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
        max-width: 680px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.6vw, 1.65rem);
        line-height: 1.45;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    p {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .about-copy > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.lead) {
        margin-top: 1.35rem;
        max-width: 680px;
        font-size: 1.03rem;
    }

    .profile-card {
        padding: 1.35rem;
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .profile-photo {
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 22px;
        background: var(--surface-muted);
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }

    .profile-photo img {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center top;
/*        filter: saturate(0.85) contrast(1.04) brightness(0.98) hue-rotate(4deg);*/
/*        filter: saturate(0.82) contrast(1.05) brightness(0.98) sepia(0.04) hue-rotate(8deg);*/
    }

    .avatar-placeholder {
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 22px;
        background:
                radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.14), transparent 14rem),
                var(--surface-muted);
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-size: 3rem;
        font-weight: 850;
        letter-spacing: -0.08em;
    }

    .profile-card h2 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .profile-card p {
        margin: 0.6rem 0 0;
    }

    .content-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    article {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding-top: 1.25rem;
    }

    h2 {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    article p {
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
    }

    ul {
        margin: 1rem 0 0;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
    }

    li + li {
        margin-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .compact-section {
        padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .note {
        padding: 1.6rem;
    }

    .note p:last-child {
        max-width: 760px;
        margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .stack-section {
        padding-top: 2rem;
    }

    .stack-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .stack-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        padding: 1.35rem;
    }

    .stack-card h3 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .stack-card p {
        margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .about-grid,
        .content-grid,
        .stack-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .profile-card {
            max-width: 420px;
        }
    }
</style>